Design a 16-bit barrel shifter that performs up to 4-bit left or right shifts based on a 4-bit shift control input. The module takes a 16-bit input signal A and shifts it accordingly, with each stage handling one bit of the shift specified by the corresponding bit in the shift input. The output, Y, reflects the shifted value of A, enabling efficient data manipulation for applications that require rapid bit shifting.
module top_module(
    input [15:0] A,
    input [3:0] shift,
    output reg [15:0] Y
);

