description:
Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
We want to create a simple SR latch that:

// (1) takes a set input 'S',
// (2) takes a reset input 'R',
// (3) outputs 'Q' which is set to 1 when 'S' is 1 and reset to 0 when 'R' is 1,
// (4) both 'S' and 'R' should not be 1 at the same time.

module sr_latch(
    input wire S,
    input wire R,
    output reg Q
);

code:
module sr_latch(
    input wire S,
    input wire R,
    output reg Q
);

    always @(*) begin
        if (S && !R)
            Q = 1;
        else if (!S && R)
            Q = 0;
        // If both S and R are 1, the output is undefined. 
        // For simplicity, we do nothing here.
    end

endmodule
